        "created_at": "2013-03-16T02:47:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When a card says it can hit up to X targets is it legal to hit the same target X times? (ie. Mister Fixer's Dual Crowbar, Wraith - Throwing Knives, Expat - Assualt Rifle))</p><p>Cause I noticed cards like Bunker's grenade launcher will specifically say it must be a second target.</p>",
