        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Granted Grenade launcher could of said deal 2 targets 2 projectile damage and deal a third target 1 projectile, but i think it looks neater since the card is a bit different then others.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There are times where you can choose to hit the same target twice or two different targets. The only ones that come to mind as of right now are Argent&#39;s Frost and Flame and Omnitron-X&#39;s Rocket Punch. The wording on those are &quot;Deal 1 target X damage. Deal 1 target X damage.&quot; The reason for it working like this is because it doesn&#39;t specify that it isn&#39;t a second target or another target or anything of the sort. Using Throwing knives you can hit up to 3 targets, if you chose the same target twice you are still only dealing 1 target damage, so it would be an invalid move.</p>",
